WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.389 --> 00:00:01.754
- All right, guys.

00:00:01.754 --> 00:00:03.389
I'm so excited about this video.

00:00:03.389 --> 00:00:05.974
I just got done packing to go to Aruba,

00:00:05.974 --> 00:00:08.212
which is an island I've
never been to before,

00:00:08.212 --> 00:00:10.791
but my girlfriend and her
family go every single year.

00:00:10.791 --> 00:00:12.998
She's been going since
she was two years old,

00:00:12.998 --> 00:00:15.257
and I've been dating her for three years.

00:00:15.257 --> 00:00:17.217
I've canceled every single year,

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:19.226
because I had to film or travel.

00:00:19.226 --> 00:00:21.334
This year I had to cancel
because I was getting surgery

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:25.439
on my ankle, but the surgery
just got moved to a later date,

00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:27.574
so I literally just bought a ticket.

00:00:27.574 --> 00:00:29.996
I'm gonna be surprising
my girlfriend in Aruba.

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:33.506
I have no plan, I don't
know what's gonna happen.

00:00:33.506 --> 00:00:35.535
You guys are just gonna
come along on the journey.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.111
I literally just bought tickets.

00:00:37.111 --> 00:00:39.042
All I know is that I need to go to bed,

00:00:39.042 --> 00:00:41.826
'cause I'm waking up at 2
a.m. to go to the airport.

00:00:41.826 --> 00:00:45.159
Let's do it (chuckles).

00:00:47.942 --> 00:00:51.693
It is 2 o'clock in the morning, let's go.

00:00:51.693 --> 00:00:52.526
Ugh,

00:00:52.526 --> 00:00:54.280
(items clatter)

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.183
Holy Shhit.

00:00:55.183 --> 00:00:57.106
(funky music)

00:00:57.106 --> 00:01:00.562
♪ Go on, go on, go on, ♪

00:01:00.562 --> 00:01:04.044
♪ I need you, you, you. ♪

00:01:04.044 --> 00:01:06.332
♪ I'll hold you. ♪

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.972
Airport's empty, everything
is going super-smoothly.

00:01:08.972 --> 00:01:11.526
My girlfriend's not texting
me, she's asleep in Aruba,

00:01:11.526 --> 00:01:14.604
so surprise is going as planned.

00:01:14.604 --> 00:01:19.000
♪ I need you, ♪

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.361
♪ Don't hold you, ♪

00:01:21.361 --> 00:01:23.027
So I guess right now would be a good time

00:01:23.027 --> 00:01:25.075
for me to tell you how
my girlfriend and I met.

00:01:25.075 --> 00:01:27.497
Basically my friend invited
me to this post-prom party.

00:01:27.497 --> 00:01:29.557
I knew nobody there, I didn't want to go,

00:01:29.557 --> 00:01:32.305
and I just randomly, I don't
know why, decided to go,

00:01:32.305 --> 00:01:34.537
and I went there, and I
noticed her right away,

00:01:34.537 --> 00:01:37.004
and I was like so
flustered and overwhelmed,

00:01:37.004 --> 00:01:39.157
I didn't know what to say to
her, and my phone was dying.

00:01:39.157 --> 00:01:41.326
All I said was, "Hey, do
you have an iPhone charger?"

00:01:41.326 --> 00:01:43.169
And she was like, "Yeah,"
and then she left,

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:45.238
and I was like, great, well
that was a dumb pick-up line,

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:47.933
because I'd just used her and have nothing

00:01:47.933 --> 00:01:50.891
to talk to her about
because she's gone now,

00:01:50.891 --> 00:01:53.986
but she ended up coming back
and she striked a conversation,

00:01:53.986 --> 00:01:56.861
and we ended up talking 'til 8 a.m.

00:01:56.861 --> 00:01:59.219
We spent the whole night just talking.

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:00.966
It was incredible, it
was the first time I felt

00:02:00.966 --> 00:02:02.633
a connection to somebody like that.

00:02:02.633 --> 00:02:03.960
The only way I could
tell her that I liked her

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:07.840
for some reason was by giving
her my phone and saying,

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:11.374
"You can delete my Tinder,"
which is a terrible line.

00:02:11.374 --> 00:02:13.439
If you like somebody,
don't say that, ever,

00:02:13.439 --> 00:02:15.221
but I guess she liked me (chuckles)

00:02:15.221 --> 00:02:16.461
so she kept talking to me.

00:02:16.461 --> 00:02:18.498
Three years later we're still dating,

00:02:18.498 --> 00:02:21.589
and it's been, it's been awesome.

00:02:21.589 --> 00:02:23.824
- [Flight Attendant] On
board (music muffles voice)

00:02:23.824 --> 00:02:26.554
comfort seated with
your seat belt fastened,

00:02:26.554 --> 00:02:29.459
seat and tray tables in
their upright position.

00:02:29.459 --> 00:02:31.321
- So I just landed, and I got a voice mail

00:02:31.321 --> 00:02:33.139
from Sabrina in the middle of the night.

00:02:33.139 --> 00:02:35.130
She does that sometimes
when she can't sleep.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.641
- [Sabrina} Hi, Babe.

00:02:36.641 --> 00:02:39.024
Just wanted to call you and tell you

00:02:39.024 --> 00:02:41.531
that I love you and I miss you,

00:02:41.531 --> 00:02:44.390
and I just can't wait to
see you after the New Year.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.030
I love you so much.

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:48.049
- All right, so I just got to the hotel.

00:02:48.049 --> 00:02:50.139
I have like 30 minutes
before Sabrina wakes up.

00:02:50.139 --> 00:02:53.419
Plan is I want to write something
like massive in the sand,

00:02:53.419 --> 00:02:55.070
have her see it from the window,

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:58.161
and then pop up behind
her in the hotel room.

00:02:58.161 --> 00:03:00.881
One minor problem, Sabrina's
sister just texted me,

00:03:00.881 --> 00:03:03.539
and the only thing they
can see from their window

00:03:03.539 --> 00:03:07.184
is this little section of
rock, so I need a new plan.

00:03:07.184 --> 00:03:08.159
I got an idea.

00:03:08.159 --> 00:03:10.248
Sabrina's sister texted
me that Sabrina woke up,

00:03:10.248 --> 00:03:12.277
so while she was getting
ready in the bathroom,

00:03:12.277 --> 00:03:14.037
I snuck in the room quietly,

00:03:14.037 --> 00:03:17.037
took out my sticky notes,
and I started to write.

00:03:17.037 --> 00:03:19.389
Sabrina and I used to always
text each other 50 things

00:03:19.389 --> 00:03:20.997
we love about the other person,

00:03:20.997 --> 00:03:24.322
so I thought why not post 50
things I love about Sabrina

00:03:24.322 --> 00:03:28.489
around the hotel, which would
lead her to me on the beach.

00:03:29.998 --> 00:03:32.428
I have a really bad feeling
about these sticky notes.

00:03:32.428 --> 00:03:34.378
I feel like someone, there
was all the cleaning crew

00:03:34.378 --> 00:03:36.194
was just like looking
at me as I put on this.

00:03:36.194 --> 00:03:37.152
(wave splashes)

00:03:37.152 --> 00:03:38.974
I should have told them not
to do anything with this.

00:03:38.974 --> 00:03:40.698
You know, I'm gonna go, I'm gonna go check

00:03:40.698 --> 00:03:44.365
on the sticky notes
super quick, one second.

00:03:48.044 --> 00:03:51.259
Somebody moved the sticky
notes, somebody cleaned them up.

00:03:51.259 --> 00:03:53.988
Oh my god, I knew that was
gonna happen, I'm so dumb.

00:03:53.988 --> 00:03:56.118
All right, new, I'm gonna
text Gabby right now.

00:03:56.118 --> 00:03:57.339
I'm gonna tell her to get rid

00:03:57.339 --> 00:03:59.638
of the sticky notes in the house,

00:03:59.638 --> 00:04:02.271
and just bring to the
beach to take a picture,

00:04:02.271 --> 00:04:05.735
and I'll surprise her
there, that's the plan.

00:04:05.735 --> 00:04:07.631
- I'm gonna pretend like this is

00:04:07.631 --> 00:04:10.351
(music muffles speech) with the rocks.

00:04:10.351 --> 00:04:11.762
Okay?

00:04:11.762 --> 00:04:14.262
(funky music)

00:04:24.481 --> 00:04:26.314
All right, now do one.

00:04:28.023 --> 00:04:31.217
(romantic piano music)

00:04:31.217 --> 00:04:32.134
- You what?

00:04:35.774 --> 00:04:36.691
- You good?

00:04:37.911 --> 00:04:39.459
- What are you?

00:04:39.459 --> 00:04:42.909
- What (laughs), what, you're,

00:04:42.909 --> 00:04:44.015
what's wrong?

00:04:44.015 --> 00:04:45.099
(Sabrina sobs)

00:04:45.099 --> 00:04:47.182
- Wait, are you sad
(laughs) that I'm here?

00:04:47.182 --> 00:04:48.573
- [Sabrina] No (sighs).

00:04:48.573 --> 00:04:49.406
- What?

00:04:49.406 --> 00:04:51.555
- [Sabrina] No, I'm just really happy.

00:04:51.555 --> 00:04:52.726
- You're happy?

00:04:52.726 --> 00:04:55.309
(Sabrina sobs)

00:04:57.087 --> 00:04:59.802
I don't understand you.

00:04:59.802 --> 00:05:01.483
- Well, I'm so confused.

00:05:01.483 --> 00:05:02.517
- I live in Aruba.

00:05:02.517 --> 00:05:04.123
- Oh, you live (laughs) in Aruba ?

00:05:04.123 --> 00:05:06.691
I just came here (laughs).

00:05:06.691 --> 00:05:08.441
- What are you doing?

00:05:14.224 --> 00:05:18.533
- Yeah, I just wanted to (chuckles).

00:05:18.533 --> 00:05:20.450
- Oh my god, oh my god.

00:05:24.211 --> 00:05:25.419
I love you.

00:05:25.419 --> 00:05:26.935
- Love you, too.

00:05:26.935 --> 00:05:28.518
- Thanks for coming.

00:05:28.518 --> 00:05:30.010
- You're welcome.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:33.677
(couple laughs and murmurs)

